SUMMARY:ASE Career Fair
DESCRIPTION:The annual ASE Career Fair at the University of Manitoba is coordinated by the Career\, Community and Experiential Learning Centre (CCELC)\, the Faculty of Agriculture Student Organization (FASO) and the University of Manitoba Engineering Society (UMES). More than 85 exhibitors participated and over 1000 students entered the career fair in 2024. 
